---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy">
  <div class="bg-gray-50 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A2B4C] mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
      
      <div class="prose prose-lg text-gray-700 max-w-none">
        <p>
          This information is provided pursuant to EU Regulation 2016/679 (GDPR). 
          The Pax et Sapientia Foundation is committed to protecting the privacy of its users.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A2B4C] mt-12 mb-4">Data Controller</h2>
        <p>
          Fondazione Benedettina Pax et Sapientia - ETS<br />
          Piazza dei Cavalieri di Malta, 5 - 00153 Rome, Italy<br />
          Email: fondazionepaxetsapientia@legalmail.it
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A2B4C] mt-12 mb-4">Data Collected</h2>
        <p>
          Through the contact form (Google Forms), we collect the data you voluntarily decide to provide us 
          (name, email, subject of the message). This data is used exclusively to respond to your requests.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A2B4C] mt-12 mb-4">Your Rights</h2>
        <p>
          You have the right to access your data, request its rectification or cancellation at any time 
          by writing to the contact details indicated above.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
